  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></math> bonds in vinyl acetate are x and y respectively. What is the sum of x + y?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "13",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Vinyl acetate has following structure<br /><math><mover><mrow><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mover><mrow><mtext></mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mtext></mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mtext></mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><mover><mrow><munder><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></mover><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext></mtext><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><munder><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></munder><mover><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext></mtext><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mo>|</mo><mtext></mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />Total <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></math> bond = x = 11<br />Total <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></math> bond = y = 2<br />Total sum x + y = 11 + 2 = 13"
  }
